  "provenance": {
    "type": "spec",
    "note": "\"Café\" and \"CAFé\" fold to \"café\". \"CAFÉ\" folds to \"cafÉ\", because É is not an ASCII letter. The no-break space of \"seal kit\" has bytes of 128 or more, so \"seal kit\" is one word and seal does not match."
  },
